  "summary": "DIR-076 complete. src/index.css now exempts seamless inputs from the global unlayered input:focus-visible outline (input:not([data-seamless='true']):not(.cuba-seamless-input):focus-visible) and adds an explicit .cuba-seamless-input:focus/.cuba-seamless-input:focus-visible override that forces outline, outline-offset, box-shadow and border off. The palette input carries data-seamless=true and the cuba-seamless-input class while keeping the borderless className substrings the dir073/dir074 suites pin, so the sharp rectangular purple box no longer renders inside the rounded search bar; the cuba-command-searchbar container remains the sole unified focus ring (focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-cuba-primary) preserving WCAG 2.1 AA SC 2.4.7 focus visibility. Gates: dir076 4/4, 141/141 pinned suites, test:product EXIT 0, security:static 67/67, xampp-policy 4/4, build 3.04s, lint 0 errors, dir063..dir076 all green, frozen cv-templates diff 0."
